    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: May 2026.</em></p>

    <p>McBride Property Management ("McBride PM," "we," "us," "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect through <a href="https://mcbride-pm.com">mcbride-pm.com</a> and our property management services, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact information</strong> you provide through forms on this site, by email, or by phone — including your name, email, phone number, mailing address, and the address of any property you want us to manage or rent.</li>
      <li><strong>Rental application information</strong> if you apply for one of our listed rentals, including identity verification, employment, income, rental history, and consent to a background and credit check. This information is collected and processed through our property management platform (AppFolio) under their privacy practices.</li>
      <li><strong>Owner and tenant account information</strong> within the AppFolio owner and resident portals — banking details for ACH, lease documents, maintenance requests, and ledger history.</li>
      <li><strong>Site usage information</strong> automatically collected by our hosting provider (Netlify) and any analytics scripts we run, including IP address, browser type, pages visited, and referring URL. We do not currently set advertising cookies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to inquiries, schedule consultations, and provide a rental analysis.</li>
      <li>To screen prospective tenants and administer leases and maintenance.</li>
      <li>To send required communications (rent reminders, maintenance updates, lease renewals, year-end 1099s).</li>
      <li>To improve our website and services.</li>
      <li>To comply with Georgia and South Carolina law and applicable real estate regulations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we share information</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your information. We share it only with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Service providers we use to run the business — including AppFolio (property management platform), our tenant screening provider, payment processors, maintenance vendors, our broker of record, and our hosting and email providers.</li>
      <li>Property owners — if you are a tenant or applicant, the property owner is entitled to information necessary to administer the lease.</li>
      <li>Government authorities or other parties when required by law, subpoena, or to protect rights, safety, or property.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain owner and lease records for as long as required by Georgia and South Carolina law and our broker recordkeeping obligations (generally several years after a lease ends). Inquiry data is retained only as long as needed to respond to your request.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You can request a copy or correction of the personal information we hold about you by emailing <a href="mailto:amber@c21magnolia.com">amber@c21magnolia.com</a>.</li>
      <li>You can opt out of marketing emails by replying "unsubscribe."</li>
      <li>Most browsers let you block cookies; doing so may affect site functionality.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Our site and services are not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above reflects the most recent change.</p>

